{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_01_beg",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_01",
  "title": "花格窗邊的夢想",
  "storyCode": "SS-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2939fbeac67751aeff5a703976fde77e3b9315bd27b21a6539bb89a34e7511b2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_mini02_victoria_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=1>維多利亞偏僻小鎮</><p=2>9:37 P.M.</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比之前預計的時間晚了整整四個小時……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有多少時間了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "街上完全沒有人，這種地方也不可能有地圖……這下麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不如我們分頭去找，有什麼情況就用通訊器聯絡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是個不錯的主意……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，其他人我都沒有意見……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但祥子你沒有單獨行動的經驗，我不會讓你一個人去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在不是考慮這種事情的時候吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她在信裡不是寫了“這是我的最後一封信”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萬一出了什麼意外，那個少女……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……紅豆，沒事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "鞭刃小姐不是說過嗎，以我現在的能力，我已經可以加入行動小組了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（拿出通訊器）要是遇到麻煩，我一定第一時間聯絡你，好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "貝娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_369_bena_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，還有我們啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好吧，那你一定要小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。愛麗絲小姐，那個孩子的名字和地址是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她叫“安”……地址是“花園街33號”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。那我們就從這個十字路口開始，分頭去找吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_mini02_victoria_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——呼——怎麼這裡的路都這麼複雜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那邊好像有個人……在賣花？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "為什麼這個時間點還有人在賣花……\n不管了，先找人比較重要！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，請問您知道花園街在哪裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賣花的婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1255_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡就是花園街。小妹妹，你要買花嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我不買花……請問您知道花園街33號怎麼走嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賣花的婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1255_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你抬頭看著天上，朝著夕陽，往西邊一直走到巷尾，最後那家就是33號了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老奶奶，現在已經是晚上了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賣花的婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1255_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，我真是越來越糊塗了……剛剛還想說怎麼路上一點腳步聲都沒有，我也該收攤回家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您看不見嗎……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賣花的婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1255_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不用管我，你不是還在找地方嗎？快點去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賣花的婦人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1255_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夜黑燈暗，小心不要再迷路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝……也請您注意安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_mini02_victoria_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=1>花園街33號</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "往西邊一直走……這裡就是那個老奶奶說的地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子緩緩推開破舊的木門，門框發出尖銳的吱呀聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔……好濃的酒味？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "地板上滿是帶著泥水的鞋印，而房間的盡頭是一個穿著邋遢的男人。\n男人環顧四周，接著一個個拿起角落裡擺放整齊的酒瓶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "空的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "空的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……還是空的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安娜！安娜！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到底跑去哪裡了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚嗚，你是不是也和那個女人一樣，丟下我跑了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔……安娜……安娜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再也不喝酒了！我會從現在開始努力！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人痛苦地跪倒，隨之而來的是一聲慘叫。\n方才打碎的酒瓶的碎片，毫不留情地刺入了他的掌心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！安娜，地板上有……血……我流血了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要死了！安娜，快點回來！我快要死了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安娜……你回來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是安娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是安娜……你是安娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醉酒的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不認識我了嗎？是我啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "男人朝祥子爬了過來，但很快又發出了一聲慘叫。\n不知為何，祥子感到一陣強烈的傷感。\n她用手扶住了殘缺的門沿——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_mini02_victoria_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫襤褸的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣衫襤褸的少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibchurch"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實那篇沒有發表的故事，才是你身上真實發生過的事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很喜歡童話。媽媽還沒離開之前，買了很多很多的童話書給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時我們一家真的很幸福，我、媽媽……還有爸爸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但媽媽離開後，那些幸福就再也沒有在我身上發生過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我嘗試把自己經歷的一切寫下來，展現給別人看，但沒有人想要看到壓抑和絕望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我才把每一句的句意都顛倒，讓它們變成最美好的童話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……可是我早就不看童話了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安娜……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（身體顫抖）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請、請不要叫那個名字……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……對不起，我不是故意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跟其他人比起來，你已經對我很溫柔了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有愛麗絲，她很擔心你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你認識愛麗絲嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我是跟她一起來找你的。我剛剛通知她了，她正在趕來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛麗絲……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不想見她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道她很忙，每天有很多很多事要處理……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是她非常重要的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其實……我今天曾無數次站在高處，然後向下望去……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我口袋裡裝滿了她寫給我的信，我的手一直緊握著它們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她鼓勵我努力活下去，還和我說，我故事裡的美夢總會到來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道該相信自己，還是該相信她……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你完全可以相信她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畢竟她是真正的仙女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仙女？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等她來了你就知道了，她說要在你成年以前——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子下意識地抬頭看向了時鐘。\n碩大的古鐘懸掛於高牆之上，時針與分針正在緩緩靠近，即將重合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟糕……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛麗絲說要在成年以前……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是指生日以前？愛麗絲要幫我慶祝生日？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，時間快來不及了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，我很久都沒有慶祝生日了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且我已經不是小孩子了。人長大之後，就不需要慶祝了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就在祥子環顧四周之時，她的視線落在了一個物品上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安，可以由我為你獻上生日祝福嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那是一架鋼琴。\n月光灑在鋼琴上，彷彿它就是為了今夜而準備的。\n就算愛麗絲的美夢不能如期而至，祥子也想用自己的方式去為安做些什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在變成“大人”之前的最後一刻，就讓我用這首安眠曲當作禮物送給你吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_661_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子緩緩走上台階，而安坐在台下。\n心跳的節拍和倒數的指針一同，在兩人之間逐漸變得清晰可聞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "撲通，撲通。\n滴答，滴答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子的雙手在黑白琴鍵間遊走著。\n音符隨流逝的時間跳躍，為女孩奇蹟般的誕生獻上最真摯的祝福。\n感謝你來到這片大地。\n希望你的未來一切順利。\n願你的童心，永不泯滅。\n隨著最後一個音符落定，教堂的鐘聲恰好敲響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生日快樂，安……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子轉身看向女孩，卻發現她已經趴在桌上睡著，表情帶著一絲香甜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "生日快樂，安。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "25_mini02_victoria_street_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "貝娜還在教堂裡等安醒過來，我們就在外面散散步吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幸好最後趕上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，有驚無險，實在是太好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你最後幫她創造了一個什麼樣的夢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個潔白的房間，乾淨得讓人覺得不可能是現實的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在房間裡，我先詢問她願不願意進入我為她創造的夢境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛麗絲確實像一位貴族小姐呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不要相信貝娜的那些話……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“進入夢境前，必須先徵求孩子的同意。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些都是夢城堡規定的必要流程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你在最後還有和她說什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在夢裡告訴安，她的文字真的很美，我希望她能一直堅持寫下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論何種風格、何種故事，甚至是不是童話都不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，這也是我想和她說的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我將她筆下的角色一一展現在她的眼前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛吃水果的蛀牙叔叔、倒立行走的玩偶小姐……他們一起舉辦了一場茶會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真好啊，要是安能一直在這個夢中就好了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夢不是用來沉溺的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再美好的夢，最終還是要醒過來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使現實生活一團亂，也要醒來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明明你和貝娜都有這麼強的源石技藝……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，你有點誤解童話和夢城堡的力量了。和現實比起來，我們的能力實在有限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們能做的，只是在孩子們內心的最深處，留下一顆種子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它可能是年少時，心裡覺得最重要的一件事，又或是一個物品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它不會時時刻刻都強調著自己的存在，但它會在關鍵的時刻、一個人最脆弱的時刻，給予他力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我是不是有點太嚴肅了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有。你說這些話的時候，眼神看起來很堅定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我相信往後的日子裡，每當安回想起你為她創造的美夢，都會拾起活下去的信心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我也相信，但是我和你的理由可能稍微有點不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在為她造夢前，我發現她心裡已經有一顆小小的種子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信念的種子，並不是只有透過夢城堡的美夢才能種下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多虧了你，祥子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對啊，祥子你的鋼琴彈得真的很好聽呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我之前就說你肯定是玩音樂的好手，之後你一定要參加羅德島上的演出哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，紅豆，你不要為難我了啦……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "就在紅豆和祥子打鬧之時，愛麗絲從小盒子中拿出了一樣東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，你之前不是說會做奇怪的夢嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個項鍊你隨身帶著，以後會少做一些惡夢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個……我真的能收下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心收下就好了，不是什麼貴重的東西，只是在上面施了一點小法術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸——我也想要！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也會做惡夢嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能……也許有吧？我不記得了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛麗絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_338_iris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我能看出來，從小到大你的睡眠品質一直都很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸——和你們這些仙女打交道真的好麻煩哦，一點秘密都沒有！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "聽著身旁同事們聊天，祥子小心翼翼地戴上了項鍊。\n一股溫柔的涼意迅速從脖頸傳遞到全身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，真美……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛麗絲、紅豆，你們看——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "空無一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "紅豆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愛麗絲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子環顧四周。\n空無一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們……人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子開始往剛才的教堂走去，她的腳步不自覺地越來越快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "貝娜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸……？為什麼會回到羅德島……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_973_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你還、好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（轉身）——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1938_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g1_rainystreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三角初華",
      "speakerId": "avg_4184_dolris_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，一切都和以前一樣……感覺就像做夢似的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸……做夢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥子，祥子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "紅豆",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太陽曬屁股啦，該起床囉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好冷……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_290_vigna_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "頭好痛……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1938_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥、子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1938_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祥——子——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔……這裡是哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g2_dreamcastlehall"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "此時此刻，她身處於一座巨大的城堡之中。\n順著巨大的落地窗向天穹望去，雙月懸於夜空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "65_g2_dreamcastlehall"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "寒冷的室溫讓她的神志清醒了一些，她開始環視四周。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（疑惑的哼唧聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些是什麼怪物？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1937_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，有人醒過來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "豐川祥子",
      "speakerId": "avg_4182_oblvns_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陰影之中，鞋跟與地面碰撞，發出一陣清脆的聲音。\n而陰影之中的人，正在朝祥子慢慢靠近。\n喀噠，喀噠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1942_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，真沒意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
